  </Collapse>

  {/* about-blog */}
  <h2 id='about-blog'>About Blog</h2>
  <p>站点历史：</p>
  <Timeline
    events={[
      {
        date: '2026-03-19',
        content:
          '基于 <a href="https://astro.build/" target="_blank">Astro</a> + <a href="https://github.com/cworld1/astro-theme-pure" target="_blank">Astro Theme Pure</a> 搭建个人博客'
      }
    ]}
  />
  <p>
    本站基于以下技术构建：
  </p>
  <ul>
